title: "MSB v3"
abstract: >-
  A sovereign, local-first, governed agent runtime: FastAPI + SQLite +
  Qwen3/Ollama + Prometheus. Takes a real task from request to a verified,
  evidence-backed result — and refuses, records, and recovers when a model,
  tool, or permission fails.
